sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Endpoint as ItemsHandler<br/>src/todo/api/http/endpoint/items.py
    participant Handler as AddItemHandler<br/>src/todo/command/add_item.py
    participant Service as ItemLists<br/>src/todo/service/item_lists.py
    participant Repository as postgres.Repository of ItemRow<br/>src/todo/infrastructure/postgres/repository.py
    participant Outcomes as translate<br/>src/todo/infrastructure/postgres/outcomes.py
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Endpoint->>+Handler: handle(AddItemCommand), through the command middleware
    Handler->>+Service: add(list_id, item)
    Service->>+Repository: insert(ItemRow)
    Repository->>+DB: INSERT INTO list_items RETURNING id, in a session of its own
    alt the row is stored
        DB-->>Repository: the generated id, committed
        Repository-->>Service: None
        Service-->>Handler: None
        Handler-->>Endpoint: AddItemResult, 201
    else unique key taken
        DB-->>-Repository: 23505
        Repository->>+Outcomes: translate(error, "insert into list_items")
        Outcomes-->>-Repository: DuplicateKeyError, the error its cause
        Repository-->>-Service: DuplicateKeyError
        Service-->>-Handler: ItemAlreadyListedError, kind conflict
        Handler-->>-Endpoint: the error, 409
    end
